<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: awful throneroom -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.awful_throneroom.label>огидна тронна зала</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.awful_throneroom.label>
  <!-- EN: I had to reign in an awful throneroom. It's like a deliberate insult from my inferiors. -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.awful_throneroom.description>Мені довелося правити в огидній тронній залі. Наче нижчі за мене навмисно мене ображають.</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.awful_throneroom.description>
  <!-- EN: dull throneroom -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.dull_throneroom.label>похмура тронна зала</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.dull_throneroom.label>
  <!-- EN: I had to reign in a dull throneroom. It clearly diminished my stature. -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.dull_throneroom.description>Мені довелося правити в похмурій тронній залі. Це явно применшило мою велич.</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.dull_throneroom.description>
  <!-- EN: mediocre throneroom -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.mediocre_throneroom.label>посередня тронна зала</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.mediocre_throneroom.label>
  <!-- EN: I had to reign in a mediocre throneroom. It didn't express my stature. -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.mediocre_throneroom.description>Мені довелося правити в посередній тронній залі. Вона не відображала моєї величі.</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.mediocre_throneroom.description>
  <!-- EN: very impressive throneroom -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.very_impressive_throneroom.label>вражаюча тронна зала</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.very_impressive_throneroom.label>
  <!-- EN: I reigned in a very impressive throneroom. It expressed noticeable stature. -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.very_impressive_throneroom.description>Я {PAWN_gender ? правив : правила} у дуже вражаючій тронній залі. Вона помітно підкреслювала мою велич.</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.very_impressive_throneroom.description>
  <!-- EN: extremely impressive throneroom -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.extremely_impressive_throneroom.label>прекрасна тронна зала</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.extremely_impressive_throneroom.label>
  <!-- EN: I reigned in an extremely impressive throneroom. It effectively demonstrated my stature. -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.extremely_impressive_throneroom.description>Я {PAWN_gender ? правив : правила} у надзвичайно вражаючій тронній залі. Вона гідно показувала мою велич.</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.extremely_impressive_throneroom.description>
  <!-- EN: unbelievably impressive throneroom -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.unbelievably_impressive_throneroom.label>казкова тронна зала</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.unbelievably_impressive_throneroom.label>
  <!-- EN: I reigned in an unbelievably impressive throneroom. The commoners will be amazed at my highness. -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.unbelievably_impressive_throneroom.description>Я {PAWN_gender ? правив : правила} у неймовірно вражаючій тронній залі. Простолюд дивуватиметься моїй величності.</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.unbelievably_impressive_throneroom.description>
  <!-- EN: wondrously impressive throneroom -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.wondrously_impressive_throneroom.label>неймовірна тронна зала</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.wondrously_impressive_throneroom.label>
  <!-- EN: I reigned in a heavenly throneroom. It matched my grace and nobility. -->
  <ReignedInThroneroom.stages.wondrously_impressive_throneroom.description>Я {PAWN_gender ? правив : правила} у божественній тронній залі. Вона була гідна моєї витонченості й шляхетності.</ReignedInThroneroom.stages.wondrously_impressive_throneroom.description>
</LanguageData>
